<h3 class="flex whitespace-pre-wrap group font-semibold" id="how-can-suppliers-change-their-accounts-in-io-worker" aria-labelledby="_R_p5deehkd74t9_"><div class="absolute" tabindex="-1"><a href="#how-can-suppliers-change-their-accounts-in-io-worker" class="-ml-10 flex items-center opacity-0 border-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus:opacity-100 focus:outline-0 group/link" aria-label="Navigate to header: How can suppliers change their accounts in IO Worker?">​<div class="size-6 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs text-gray-400 dark:text-white/50 dark:bg-background-dark dark:brightness-[1.35] dark:ring-1 dark:hover:brightness-150 bg-white ring-1 ring-gray-400/30 dark:ring-gray-700/25 hover:ring-gray-400/60 dark:hover:ring-white/20 group-focus/link:border-2 group-focus/link:border-primary dark:group-focus/link:border-primary-light"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" stroke-width="2" class="size-3 shrink-0"><use href="#mi-mint-1-Link"></use></svg></div></a></div><span id="_R_p5deehkd74t9_" class="cursor-pointer">How can suppliers change their accounts in IO Worker?</span></h3>
<span data-as="p">To change accounts, suppliers should include the <strong>—no_cache=true</strong> flag in the binary run command. This triggers a re-authentication process. Simply add <strong>—no_cache=true</strong> at the end of your main request when connecting the device with the new login.</span>
<div data-orientation="horizontal" data-activation-direction="none" class="code-group p-0.5 mt-5 mb-8 flex flex-col not-prose relative rounded-2xl border border-gray-950/10 dark:border-white/10 min-w-0 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-white/5 dark:codeblock-dark text-gray-950 dark:text-gray-50 codeblock-light"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 relative pr-2.5" data-component-part="code-group-tab-bar"><div role="presentation" style="position:relative;--scroll-area-corner-height:0px;--scroll-area-corner-width:0px" data-component-part="scroll-area" class="min-w-0 flex-1 w-0 rounded-tl-xl"><div data-id="base-ui-_R_kt5deehkd74t9_-viewport" tabindex="-1" class="size-full rounded-[inherit] [--scroll-area-fade-size:32px] overflow-y-hidden! base-ui-disable-scrollbar" style="overflow:scroll" data-component-part="scroll-area-viewport"><div role="presentation" style="min-width:fit-content" data-component-part="scroll-area-content"><div data-orientation="horizontal" data-activation-direction="none" role="tablist" aria-label="Code examples" class="text-xs leading-6 gap-1 flex"><button type="button" data-active="" data-orientation="horizontal" data-activation-direction="none" aria-disabled="false" tabindex="-1" role="tab" aria-selected="true" id="base-ui-_R_2qkt5deehkd74t9_" data-composite-item-active="" class="group flex items-center relative gap-1.5 my-1 mb-1.5 outline-0 whitespace-nowrap font-medium ml-0! first:ml-2.5! focus-visible:outline-hidden text-primary dark:text-primary-light"><div class="peer/title flex items-center gap-1.5 px-1.5 rounded-lg z-10 group-focus-visible:outline-1 group-focus-visible:outline-primary dark:group-focus-visible:outline-primary-light group-hover:bg-gray-200/50 dark:group-hover:bg-gray-700/70 group-hover:text-primary dark:group-hover:text-primary-light">MacOs</div><div class="absolute -bottom-1.5 left-0 right-0 h-0.5 rounded-full bg-primary dark:bg-primary-light peer-empty/title:hidden"></div></button><button type="button" data-orientation="h